about to redraw."}]}],"name":"mapView"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method is called any time the map view needs to redraw due to a change in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the viewpoint or style property transition. This method may be called very","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"frequently, even moreso than ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapViewRegionIsChanging:"},{"text":". Therefore, your","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implementation of this method should be as lightweight as possible to avoid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"affecting performance.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate":{"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"},{"text":" protocol defines a set of optional methods that you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can use to receive map-related update messages. Because many map operations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"require the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"},{"text":" class to load data asynchronously, the map view calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these methods to notify your application when specific operations complete. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"map view also uses these methods to request information about annotations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed on the map, such as the styles and interaction modes to apply to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"individual annotations.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","ty